{"seq":2,"slug":"community-building","title":"社区建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/open-source-your-tools/community-building","wordCount":1226,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"社区建设\">社区建设</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>代码开源只是起点，社区才是开源项目的生命力所在。没有社区的开源项目只是&quot;公开的个人项目&quot;——它可能有用户，但不会有贡献者、不会有生态、不会有超越个人能力的演进。社区建设不是&quot;发完代码等人来&quot;的被动过程，而是需要有意识设计和持续投入的主动工程。</p>\n<p>成功的开源社区有一个共同特征：降低贡献门槛。Rust 社区以其友好的编译器错误信息和详尽的贡献文档闻名。Vue.js 社区通过中文文档和活跃的论坛吸引了大量非英语母语的贡献者。这些不是偶然的——它们是社区建设者有意识设计的结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"贡献者漏斗模型\">贡献者漏斗模型</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Visitor: finds your project&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;User: installs and uses&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Reporter: files an issue&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Contributor: submits a PR&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Maintainer: takes ownership&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Visitor: finds your project\"] --&gt; B[\"User: installs and uses\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Reporter: files an issue\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Contributor: submits a PR\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Maintainer: takes ownership\"]</pre><p>每一层都有大量流失。你的工作是最大化每层的转化率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>典型转化率</th>\n<th>如何提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Visitor → User</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>清晰的 README + 安装简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>User → Reporter</td>\n<td>2-5%</td>\n<td>低门槛的 Issue 模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reporter → Contributor</td>\n<td>1-3%</td>\n<td>标记 good first issue + 友好回复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Contributor → Maintainer</td>\n<td>&lt;1%</td>\n<td>赋予权限 + mentor</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"社区健康指标\">社区健康指标</h3><p>衡量社区健康的关键指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Issue 响应时间</strong>：首次回复的中位时间（目标 &lt;48h）</li>\n<li><strong>PR 合并时间</strong>：从提交到合并的中位时间（目标 &lt;7 天）</li>\n<li><strong>贡献者多样性</strong>：非创始人的 commit 占比</li>\n<li><strong>Issue 关闭率</strong>：已关闭 / 总 Issue</li>\n<li><strong>回头客比例</strong>：提交 2+ PR 的贡献者占比</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"contributing-md-的核心要素\">CONTRIBUTING.md 的核心要素</h3><p>这是新贡献者的&quot;入门手册&quot;，需要包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# Contributing to [project-name]&#10;&#10;## Development Setup&#10;&#10;1. Fork and clone&#10;2. Install dependencies: `npm install`&#10;3. Run tests: `npm test`&#10;4. Make changes&#10;5. Submit PR&#10;&#10;## Code Style&#10;&#10;- We use [prettier/rustfmt/black] for formatting&#10;- Run `npm run lint` before committing&#10;&#10;## Commit Messages&#10;&#10;We follow Conventional Commits:&#10;&#10;- feat: new feature&#10;- fix: bug fix&#10;- docs: documentation&#10;- refactor: code refactoring&#10;&#10;## Pull Request Process&#10;&#10;1. Create a branch from `main`&#10;2. Write tests for new functionality&#10;3. Ensure all tests pass&#10;4. Update documentation if needed&#10;5. Submit PR with clear description&#10;&#10;## Getting Help&#10;&#10;- Open a Discussion for questions&#10;- Join our Discord/Slack (if applicable)&#10;- Tag issues with `help wanted` or `good first issue`\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># Contributing to [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">project-name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Development Setup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fork and clone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Install dependencies: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`npm install`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Run tests: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`npm test`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">4.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Make changes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">5.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Submit PR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Code Style</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> We use [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">prettier/rustfmt/black</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] for formatting</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Run </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`npm run lint`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> before committing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Commit Messages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">We follow Conventional Commits:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feat: new feature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fix: bug fix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> docs: documentation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refactor: code refactoring</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Pull Request Process</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Create a branch from </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`main`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Write tests for new functionality</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Ensure all tests pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">4.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Update documentation if needed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">5.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Submit PR with clear description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Getting Help</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Open a Discussion for questions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Join our Discord/Slack (if applicable)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Tag issues with </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`help wanted`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> or </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`good first issue`</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"处理第一个外部-pr\">处理第一个外部 PR</h3><p>第一个来自社区的 PR 是关键时刻。你的回应方式定义了社区文化：</p>\n<p><strong>Good Response Pattern</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"Thanks for this PR! I really appreciate you taking the time to contribute.&#10;&#10;Overall, this looks great! A few small suggestions:&#10;&#10;1. [具体的、可操作的反馈]&#10;2. [解释&quot;为什么&quot;而不只是&quot;要改&quot;]&#10;&#10;Would you be open to making these adjustments? Happy to answer any questions. If you&#39;re busy, I can also make these changes and credit you as co-author.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Thanks for this PR! I really appreciate you taking the time to contribute.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Overall, this looks great! A few small suggestions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">具体的、可操作的反馈</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">解释\"为什么\"而不只是\"要改\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Would you be open to making these adjustments? Happy to answer any questions. If you're busy, I can also make these changes and credit you as co-author.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Bad Response Pattern</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"This doesn&#39;t follow our coding style. Please fix.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">This doesn't follow our coding style. Please fix.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>先感谢，再建议</li>\n<li>解释原因，不只是要求</li>\n<li>提供帮助的意愿</li>\n<li>如果小问题，自己改并归功于贡献者</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"设计-good-first-issue\">设计 &quot;Good First Issue&quot;</h3><p>好的入门 Issue 应该具备：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 🆕 Good First Issue: Add --quiet flag&#10;&#10;### What&#10;&#10;Add a `--quiet` / `-q` flag that suppresses non-error output.&#10;&#10;### Why&#10;&#10;Users in CI environments want minimal output. Currently there&#39;s no way to reduce verbosity.&#10;&#10;### How (suggested approach)&#10;&#10;1. Add `--quiet` to the argument parser (see `src/cli.ts` line 45)&#10;2. Pass `quiet` flag to the output formatter&#10;3. When quiet=true, only print errors to stderr&#10;4. Add a test case (see `tests/cli.test.ts` for examples)&#10;&#10;### Acceptance Criteria&#10;&#10;- [ ] `tool --quiet` produces no stdout output on success&#10;- [ ] Errors still print to stderr&#10;- [ ] `tool --help` shows the new flag&#10;- [ ] Test passes&#10;&#10;### Hints&#10;&#10;- Look at how `--verbose` is implemented for reference&#10;- The output logic is in `src/output.ts`&#10;&#10;### Difficulty: ⭐ (Easy)&#10;&#10;Estimated time: 30-60 minutes\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 🆕 Good First Issue: Add --quiet flag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### What</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Add a </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`--quiet`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> / </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`-q`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag that suppresses non-error output.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Why</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Users in CI environments want minimal output. Currently there's no way to reduce verbosity.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### How (suggested approach)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Add </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`--quiet`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to the argument parser (see </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`src/cli.ts`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line 45)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Pass </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`quiet`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag to the output formatter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> When quiet=true, only print errors to stderr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">4.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Add a test case (see </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`tests/cli.test.ts`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> for examples)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Acceptance Criteria</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`tool --quiet`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> produces no stdout output on success</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] Errors still print to stderr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`tool --help`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shows the new flag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] Test passes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Hints</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Look at how </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`--verbose`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is implemented for reference</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> The output logic is in </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`src/output.ts`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Difficulty: ⭐ (Easy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Estimated time: 30-60 minutes</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"建立响应节奏\">建立响应节奏</h3><p>你不需要 24/7 在线，但需要建立可预测的响应节奏：</p>\n<p><strong>推荐节奏</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Issue 首次回复：48 小时内</li>\n<li>PR Review 首次回复：72 小时内</li>\n<li>如果忙，留一条&quot;我看到了，这周会详细看&quot;的消息</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自动化辅助</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stale Bot：自动标记 30 天无活动的 Issue</li>\n<li>Auto-label：根据文件路径自动添加标签</li>\n<li>PR Template：引导贡献者提供必要信息</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"管理期望\">管理期望</h3><p>在 README 或 CONTRIBUTING.md 中明确设定期望：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## Response Times&#10;&#10;This is a side project maintained in my spare time. Please expect:&#10;&#10;- Issue triage: within 1 week&#10;- PR review: within 2 weeks&#10;- Feature requests: evaluated monthly&#10;&#10;I appreciate your patience! If something is urgent, please mention it in the issue.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Response Times</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">This is a side project maintained in my spare time. Please expect:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Issue triage: within 1 week</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PR review: within 2 weeks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Feature requests: evaluated monthly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">I appreciate your patience! If something is urgent, please mention it in the issue.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>诚实设定期望比让人等待然后失望要好得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"社区文化塑造\">社区文化塑造</h3><p>通过你的行为定义社区文化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>鼓励提问</strong>：没有&quot;愚蠢的问题&quot;——如果文档没解释清楚，那是文档的问题</li>\n<li><strong>赞美努力</strong>：即使 PR 最终不能合并，也要感谢贡献者的时间</li>\n<li><strong>透明决策</strong>：解释&quot;为什么不&quot;和&quot;为什么要&quot;——让人理解你的考量</li>\n<li><strong>承认错误</strong>：如果你犯了错，公开承认并改正</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"利用-github-功能\">利用 GitHub 功能</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Discussions</strong>：用于问答和想法讨论（比 Issue 更轻量）</li>\n<li><strong>Projects</strong>：公开路线图，让社区知道方向</li>\n<li><strong>Releases</strong>：每个版本写清晰的 Release Notes</li>\n<li><strong>Wiki</strong>：让社区贡献知识库文档</li>\n<li><strong>Labels</strong>：体系化的 Issue 分类（bug, enhancement, good first issue, help wanted）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"避免-burnout\">避免 Burnout</h3><p>社区维护的最大风险是 burnout。保护自己：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设定每周投入上限（如：周末 4 小时）</li>\n<li>不要在下班后立即回复 Issue（建立&quot;非即时&quot;的预期）</li>\n<li>授权信任的贡献者为 collaborator</li>\n<li>对超出范围的需求说 &quot;No&quot;（友好但坚定）</li>\n<li>定期休息并公开告知社区</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"社区管理工具\">社区管理工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Probot/actions-stale</td>\n<td>自动管理过期 Issue/PR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>all-contributors</td>\n<td>可视化贡献者列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Danger.js</td>\n<td>PR 自动化检查（大小、CHANGELOG）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub Discussions</td>\n<td>社区问答和讨论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Discord/Slack</td>\n<td>实时社区交流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"社区建设参考\">社区建设参考</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Rust RFC 流程</strong> — 透明的决策机制</li>\n<li><strong>Vue.js 贡献指南</strong> — 多语言、详细的入门路径</li>\n<li><strong>React 社区规范</strong> — Code of Conduct 实践</li>\n<li><strong>Astro 的 Discord 社区</strong> — 活跃且友好的实时交流</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>社区建设是一个长期投入的过程，但它的回报是指数级的——一个健康的社区能让项目超越任何个人的能力和时间限制。</p>\n<p>社区建设的核心原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>降低门槛</strong>：让贡献变得简单（清晰的文档、标记好的入门 Issue）</li>\n<li><strong>及时响应</strong>：48 小时内至少留言表示看到了</li>\n<li><strong>友好友好再友好</strong>：第一个 PR 的体验决定了贡献者是否会回来</li>\n<li><strong>设定期望</strong>：诚实说明响应时间，好过让人等待</li>\n<li><strong>保护自己</strong>：设定投入上限，授权他人，防止 burnout</li>\n<li><strong>透明决策</strong>：让社区理解项目方向和决策逻辑</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"社区建设","id":"社区建设"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"贡献者漏斗模型","id":"贡献者漏斗模型"},{"level":3,"text":"社区健康指标","id":"社区健康指标"},{"level":3,"text":"CONTRIBUTING.md 的核心要素","id":"contributing-md-的核心要素"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"处理第一个外部 PR","id":"处理第一个外部-pr"},{"level":3,"text":"设计 \"Good First Issue\"","id":"设计-good-first-issue"},{"level":3,"text":"建立响应节奏","id":"建立响应节奏"},{"level":3,"text":"管理期望","id":"管理期望"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"社区文化塑造","id":"社区文化塑造"},{"level":3,"text":"利用 GitHub 功能","id":"利用-github-功能"},{"level":3,"text":"避免 Burnout","id":"避免-burnout"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"社区管理工具","id":"社区管理工具"},{"level":3,"text":"社区建设参考","id":"社区建设参考"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"开源准备清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/open-source-your-tools/open-source-readiness-checklist"},"next":{"title":"维护与演进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/open-source-your-tools/maintenance-evolution-strategy"}}